Z||000013||Oreif||06-21-2001||01:58 AM||||MM, Check out the link below. Their prices are better than Crutchfields and they have a larger selection. <A HREF="http://www.onlinecarstereo.com/caraudio/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.onlinecarstereo.com/caraudio/</A> <P>They have a Kenwood that works good in a .51 box and it's only $59.00 <A HREF="http://www.onlinecarstereo.com/caraudio/product.asp?sku=10166" TARGET=_blank>http://www.onlinecarstereo.com/caraudio/product.asp?sku=10166</A> <P>MTX for $69.00 <A HREF="http://www.onlinecarstereo.com/caraudio/product.asp?sku=10633" TARGET=_blank>http://www.onlinecarstereo.com/caraudio/product.asp?sku=10633</A> <P>A Kicker F series for $99.00 <A HREF="http://www.onlinecarstereo.com/caraudio/product.asp?sku=10297" TARGET=_blank>http://www.onlinecarstereo.com/caraudio/product.asp?sku=10297</A> <P>Cerwin Vega Stealth for $79.00 <A HREF="http://www.onlinecarstereo.com/caraudio/product.asp?sku=10547" TARGET=_blank>http://www.onlinecarstereo.com/caraudio/product.asp?sku=10547</A> <P>Orion for $89.00 <A HREF="http://www.onlinecarstereo.com/caraudio/product.asp?sku=11246" TARGET=_blank>http://www.onlinecarstereo.com/caraudio/product.asp?sku=11246</A> <P>Chck them out. (I'd go with the Cerwin Vega for the small enclosure personally)<BR>------------------<BR>       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/LOGO3.jpg">     <BR><B><I>Got Emblems?</I></B><p>[This message has been edited by Oreif (edited 06-21-2001).]||||reg||1
